# Traditional Jhyaure Taal (6/8) — Lok Dohori & Hill Folk Songs
#
# 6-Matra Cycle (१ २ ३ ४ ५ ६):
#   Beat 1 (१): घिं (Ghin)  — open stroke on the large head (bhale)
#   Beat 2 (२): X   (-)     — rest; Beat 1's Ghin rings across Beat 2
#   Beat 3 (३): तां (Taang) — open index-finger stroke on the small head (pothi)
#   Beat 4 (४): तक् (Taak)  — closed 3-finger stroke on the small head (pothi)
#   Beat 5 (५): घिं (Ghin)  — open stroke on the large head (bhale)
#   Beat 6 (६): तां (Taang) — open index-finger stroke on the small head (pothi)
#
# Kaat / Turnaround (काट — १ २ ३ ४ ५ ६):
#   तां घिं तां घिं तां X  (Beat 6 is silent)
@title: Traditional Jhyaure Taal
@taal: Jhyaure
@tempo: 180
@meter: 6/8
@region: Nepal (Lok Dohori & Hill Folk Songs)
@tali: 1, 4
@khali: 2

[Theka]
| >Ghin - Taang : Taak Ghin Taang | x4

[Kaat]
| >Taang Ghin Taang : Ghin Taang - | x2

[Lekali He Choyako Doko]
| >Ghin - Taang : Taak Ghin Taang | x3
| >Taang Ghin Taang : Ghin Taang - |


